  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.title">Switch cashier</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.message">Enter the next cashier's login and password. The current shift will be closed (as with a normal shift close). Nothing changes until valid details are entered.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.emailWatermark">Email</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.passwordWatermark">Password</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.confirmButton">Switch</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.tabReorder">Restock</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.reorderSubtitle">Calculated from sales recorded on this till. Empty if there have been no sales yet or if less than a couple of days have passed since the update.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.lookbackLabel">Calculate sales rate over:</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colDailyRate">Sales/day</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colDaysLeft">Days left</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.reorderEmpty">Not enough sales history for a forecast yet. Click "Pull history from server" or wait a few days — the till collects data automatically after every sale.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.backfillButton">Pull history from server</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.tabExpiry">Expiry dates</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.expirySubtitle">Expiry date is estimated from the product category (no real web search without an AI key, see Settings). Intake date is when the product first had stock on this till.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colIntakeDate">Received</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colExpiryDate">Expires on</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.expiryEmpty">No products with a known intake date yet — it is recorded automatically as soon as a product has stock.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyTitle">Loyalty program</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltySubtitle">The balance is stored locally on this till — NurCRM doesn't have a points field for clients yet.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyEnable">Enable points</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyEarnPercent">Earn rate, % of receipt total</x:String>
