  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.layoutsTab">Till layouts</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.layoutsTitle">Main till screen layout</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.layoutsDesc">Six layouts for the main screen. Click a card and the till switches instantly, no restart needed; the customer display changes along with it.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.customerDisplayTitle">Customer display</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.customerDisplayEditorButton">Customer display editor</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.monitor.styleTitle">Customer display layout</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.monitor.openEditor">Open editor</x:String>
  <!-- 2026-09-28: редизайн Настройки → Весы и окна «Весы», мастер «Настроить по этикетке» -->
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.tab.weighing">Scale at the till</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.tab.label">Label scales</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.tab.barcode">Barcode: weight / amount</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.tab.display">Price display</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.weighing.title">Scale at the till (weighing)</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.weighing.desc">The scale at the till is connected to the computer by cable (COM/USB): the till reads the weight itself while the item is on the scale.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.label.title">Label-printing scales</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.label.desc">Floor scales print a label with a barcode. The till sends them the list of weighed goods with prices. Choose your scale brand — only its settings appear below.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.brand.shtrikh">Shtrih-PRINT (Shtrih-M)</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.brand.shtrikh.sub">Directly over the network or via the NurCRM server</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.brand.rongta.sub">RLS1000 / RLS1100 — via the RLS1000 software</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.brand.tm.sub">Dahua TM-A / TM-F — over the network, port 4001</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.brand.ai.sub">A list file for the scale’s software</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.route.label">How to send goods</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.route.server">Via the NurCRM server</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.route.direct">Directly over the network</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rongta.hint">Rongta has no network protocol of its own: the till prepares the list and starts the upload in RLS1000. The address and port here are for “Check connection”.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rongta.routeSite">Via the website and RLS1000</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rongta.routeServer">Till’s own server</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rongta.routeLan">Directly over the network (no RLS1000)</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rongta.serverPort">Own server port</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.tm.hint">The till sends goods to the scale itself over the network (TCP). The default port is 4001; the scale address is in “Russian Scale”: “Communication settings → Ethernet settings”.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.ai.hint">AI scales have no common protocol — each model comes with its own software. The till saves a file (PLU, name, unit, price) and you load it with the scale’s software. No address is needed.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.btn.check">Check connection</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.btn.find">Find on network…</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.btn.settings">Scale settings…</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.btn.send">Send goods →</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.barcode.open">Weight / amount →</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.barcode.title">How the till reads the scale label barcode</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.barcode.desc">A weight barcode has 13 digits: prefix 20–29, item code, weight or amount and a check digit. The company sets the layout and mode on the NurCRM website (Scales → Settings); the till receives them at login.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.wizard.title">Set up from a label</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.wizard.desc">The amount on the receipt does not match the label? Scan the barcode from a printed label (or type 13 digits) — the till shows two readings: as WEIGHT and as AMOUNT. Press the one that matches the label — the till remembers it for the prefix and reads that way at once.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.wizard.parse">Read</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.wizard.open">Set up from a label…</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rules.title">What the scale prints in the barcode</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.rules.reset">Reset rules (the till will ask again)</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.windowTitle">Send goods to the scale</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.change">Change…</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.colStatus">Result</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.saveFile">Save file…</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.list.title">Scales in the shop</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.list.desc">Each scale has its own brand, address and product categories. “Configure…” opens that scale, “Send goods” sends its goods to it.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scaleSetup.list.add">+ Add a scale</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.colHotkey">Key</x:String>
  <!-- 2026-09-29: кнопка «Обновить» в окне «Весы» теперь явно загружает каталог с сервера NurCRM. -->
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.refreshFromServer">Refresh from server</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.refreshFromServerTip">Download products, prices and PLUs from the NurCRM server again and rebuild the list. Without internet the saved catalog stays.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="scalesPlu.colCategory">Category</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="finance.kpiDetailsTip">Tap for details: receipts and products for the period</x:String>
